Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:24:24 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(app): STEP import reads the file's length unit

The importer read every STEP coordinate as millimetres, so a part saved
in metres imported 1000x too small and one in inches 25.4x (#306). It
now resolves the representation contexts' LENGTH_UNIT (SI prefix, or a
conversion-based unit through its measure) and scales the tessellated
vertices to millimetres; an unreadable or contradictory unit refuses by
name, and a file with none keeps millimetres.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
