Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(app): the STEP unit tests' fixture carries a full
 Part 21 header

ruststep's tokenizer refuses an empty HEADER section, so the four unit
tests failed before reaching the reader. They now build the header the
way exporters write it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
